  "description": "Demonstrates the \"pathPattern\" date-range feature: events are written one file per day (events/dt=YYYY-MM-DD/events.parquet). Every panel's target sets pathPattern=\"events/dt={date}/events.parquet\" instead of a fixed path, so changing the top-right time-picker (e.g. \"Last 7 days\" vs \"Last 14 days\") automatically expands the query to the matching set of daily files - no manual file selection required. Panels additionally filter on the event_time TIMESTAMP column with WHERE event_time >= $__from AND event_time <= $__to, so results are precise down to the exact moment selected in the time-picker, not just whole days.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
